I'm in favour of a new process model for the formalisation of the language,=
 in particular using a Git repository hosted through Github, Bitbucket or s=
imilar, and having a hierarchical structure of contributors arranged by spe=
ciality making pull requests and merges.  Someone of selpa'i-level of langu=
age intimacy/mastery if not selpa'i himself being sat atop is fine with me =
too.  There would always need to be some kind of final arbiter at the top o=
f the merge cascade, though it could be devolved to a small BPFK-style grou=
p implementing majority voting.

kozmikreis
(Paul Swift, LLG Member)

